  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a vector that is the current camera position for the agent the task has permissions for.</p>
  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_TRACK_CAMERA" target="_blank">PERMISSION_TRACK_CAMERA</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>.</p>
</p>
